cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark, please cite the paper below."
title: "FaceBase 3D Encoder Benchmark: from screening to differential diagnosis"
abstract: >-
  Code, subject-level split manifests, and result tables for a registration-free
  benchmark of 3D facial representations for craniofacial screening, cleft
  subtyping and 49-class genetic syndrome diagnosis on six FaceBase cohorts,
  evaluated over five training seeds, with region-occlusion interpretability.
